  "details": "this is gonna be a bit controversial, but I think the devs should remove the social ranks. As a trusted user myself, I really wish we could go back to when everyone was on the same level. Not to mention that the game literally limits you on who you can interact with based on your rank. as A trusted user, I really only see known to trusted users in a lobby, but on a fresh account I can talk with visitors to users. I've also seen plenty of people get into arguments about how \"I'm better than you because I'm a higher rank\". It's stupid to create some false social hierarchy in a video game that already has plenty of toxic groups of people.",
